        ],
        "text": "The case concerns Illinois\u2019s operational\u2011function tax and whether it can be applied to MeadWestvaco\u2019s sales, with questions about the unitary\u2011business doctrine."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The key legal question is whether the unitary\u2011business doctrine applies, allowing Illinois to tax the sale, or whether the tax results in prohibited double taxation."
      }
