              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked whether the trial court had found the business to be non\u2011unitary and whether that finding was undisturbed on appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy inquired whether, assuming the unitary\u2011business argument is met, Illinois has the right to tax the sale or part of it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned how the tax amount was computed if the unitary\u2011business approach was not applied."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0002-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia clarified that the tax is imposed on Mead, not on Lexis/Nexis."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7a06624cf9c524c78a424c4bdc2f948806413eae4416d361f51e00b3b88aa698",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7a06624cf9c5-0002-0006"
