          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Beth S. Brinkmann, petitioner argues that the Illinois appellate court\u2019s ruling dramatically expanded the state\u2019s operational\u2011function tax, which the petitioner says violates constitutional limits on state taxing authority."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Barov",
